        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CL50xFLC, Grade 1 Commercial Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to be easily gripped and held, the CL50xFLC Grade 1 Commercial Lever is a stylish choice.  This leverset is adjustable to fit 1-3/8\" up to 2\" door thicknesses, and is can be ordered with either 2-3/4\" or or 2 3/8\" backsets. And since it is available in passage, privacy, entrance, storeroom, and classroom functions, you will be sure to find just what you are looking for. It comes finished in satin chrome, polished brass, or oil rubbed bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/grade-2-commercial-door-lever\"><b>Deltana CL500EVC Grade 2 Commercial Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the CL50xFLC Commercial Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 1 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>UL listed chrome plated latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Universal lever.</li>\r\n<li>Lock cylinder: 6 pin solid brass \"C\" keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>Fixed throughbolts for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Clutch function helps deter from breaking the mechanism. This means that when the lever is locked, it still will turn freely without retracting the latch.</li>\r\n<li>The housing is made of cold rolled steel and zinc dichromated finish for rust resistance.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a>.</li>\r\n<li><b>5 year limited mechanical warranty with a 1 year limited finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Commercial Grade 1 Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1/2\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Latch Front: 2-1/4\" x 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/4\" x 4-7/8\" x 1 3/16\" lip to center. (Standard <a href=\"/products/ansi-strike-plate-deltana-span478\"><b>ANSI Strike Plate</b></a>)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-CL500FLC-specifications.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Dorallock CL500FLC Grade 1 Commercial Lever Specifications (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet)(ANSI F75):</b> Latchbolt operated by lever from either side at all times. For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom)(ANSI F76):</b> Latchbolt operated by lever from either side or emergency release in outside lever. Outside locked by push button on inside lever. Outside lever unlocked by emergency release in outside lever, rotating inside lever or closing door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Entrance (office lock)(ANSI F109):</b> Outside lever locked by push/turn button inside. When outside lever is locked by push button inside - key from outside or rotating inside lever unlocks outside lever. When outside lever is locked by pushing and turning the button inside - key from outside or rotating inside lever retracts the latch but does not unlock outside lever. Deadlocking latchbolt operated by inside lever at all times.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom (ANSI F84):</b> Latchbolt operated by a lever from either side. Outside lever locked and unlocked by key. Inside lever always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom (ANSI F86):</b> Outside lever fixed. Entry by key only. Inside lever always free (unlocked).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 1 Commercial Door Lever, Deltana CL50xFLC",
                "description": "Deltana CL500FLC, Grade 1 Commercial Lever - Designed to be easily gripped and held, the DoralLock CL500FLC Grade 1 Commercial Lever is a stylish choice. This leverset is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inch up to 2 inch door thicknesses with backset for either 2-3/4 inch or or 2-3/8 inch backsets. And since it is available in passage, privacy, entrance, storeroom, and classroom functions, you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.  It comes finished in satin chrome, polished brass, or oil rubbed bronze.",
                "keywords": "DOR-CL500FLC, dorallock cl500flc, dorrallock cl500flc entry, dorrallock cl501flc passage, dorrallock cl520flc privacy, dorrallock cl504flc storeroom, dorrallock cl509flc classroom, grade 1 levers, commercial leversets, commercial grade 1 levers,  ANSI F75, ANSI F76, ANSI F82, ANSI F84, ANSI F86, DEL-CL50xFLC Grade 1 Commercial Levers"
